  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 花後に切り戻すと整い新しい葉が出る（夏の傷み・夏前の話はないので、人が決めた例のアルケミラと同じく B）。Walters・MBG・stauden.de（品種）: 花がら摘み、咲き終わった茎を切る。機械の C から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "Cut back after flowers have faded to tidy and encourage a fresh flush of leaf growth",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[日照] 今のマスターの日照（日向〜半日陰）で西日耐性を決め直した（文献の日照 半日陰 なら ×）\n[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: 普 通 向きますが高温多湿は嫌います（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Best performance occurs in cool summer climates where night temperatures consistently dip below 70F degrees, which unfortunately is a cultural preference that does not fit the profile of a typical St.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or North-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 2／MBG・品種] plants will spread by stolons ... to form colonies / May form colonies over time（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] will spread by stolons and/or self-seeding in a non-invasive manner / Deadhead flowerheads after bloom if self-seeding is unwanted（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] In optimum growing conditions, plants will spread by stolons and/or self-seeding in a non-invasive manner to form colonies.\n[地下茎 2／MBG・品種] Noteworthy Characteristics Astrantia major , commonly called greater masterwort, is an upright, umbelliferous, stoloniferous, herbaceous perennial (carrot family) that is native to mountain meadows, grasslands, woodland \n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
